{
  "slug": "spanner",
  "name": "Spanner",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect and interact with Spanner data using natural language.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `spanner`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install spanner@claude-plugins-official` from `gemini-cli-extensions/spanner`.\n\nThis repository packages MCP Toolbox's prebuilt `spanner` server as a plugin/extension to interact with Google Cloud Spanner instances. It can be used with various AI agents, including Antigravity, Claude Code and Codex, to manage your databases, execute queries, explore schemas, and troubleshoot issues using natural language prompts.",
